                <head>The Monroe Doctrine</head>
                <p>[The following documents concerning the Monroe Doctrine represent discussion and
                    do not necessarily reflect the official positions on policy taken by this
                    Government. For any expressions of definitive official positions on policy
                    respecting the matters discussed in these papers, reference is made to such
                    documents as appear in the annual volumes of <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi> for the years 1914 to 1920.]</p>





